# --- Local-only docs (private notes, not for the public repo) ---
FILE-MAP.md
JOBWATCH_HANDOVER.md
JOBWATCH_V2_HANDOVER.md

# --- Personal data (lives in ~/JobWatchData, outside the repo — belt-and-braces) ---
JobWatchData/
